  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## What listeners single out\n\n- Notes mention a Blues For Allah jam as part of the show's content [1]\n\n## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Easy Answers**: rare: 9 archived performances [5]\n- **Mississippi Half-Step Uptown Toodleoo**: back after 152 archived shows (1609 days); rare: 5 archived performances [5]\n- **William Tell Bridge**: rare: 14 archived performances [5]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **deadco2021-10-27.dpa4022** (recommended): source not stated; 18 songs; 189 min; rated 1.67/5 by 3 [1]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Reviewer sat in a slow parking line and missed the whole first set; calls this venue's parking the worst they've experienced [3]\n- Reviewer has attended at this venue under its earlier names Sleep Train and Mattress Firm [3]\n- Inside, the crowd included spinning, twirling dancers, and the atmosphere made the reviewer forget the parking trouble [3]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **deadco2021-10-27.dpa4022**: taped by John Hermsen; transferred by John Hermsen; source: DPA 4022 > Sound Devices Mixpre 6 [1]\n\n## Art and photos\n\n- Fan art by L. Paul Mann: [Dead & Company | North Island Credit Union Amphitheatre | 10/27/21](https://www.gratefulweb.com/articles/dead-company-north-island-credit-union-amphitheatre-10-27-21/) [6]\n- Fan art by Fatima Kelley: [Photos + Review: Dead & Company @ North Island Credit Union Amphitheatre (Chula Vista, CA) - Mezzic](https://www.mezzic.com/concert-photos/photos-review-dead-company-north-island-credit-union-amphitheatre-chula-vista-ca/) [7]\n- Fan art by Fatima Kelley: [Photos + Review: Dead & Company @ North Island Credit Union Amphitheatre (Chula Vista, CA) - Mezzic](https://www.mezzic.com/concert-photos/photos-review-dead-company-north-island-credit-union-amphitheatre-chula-vista-ca/) [8]\n- Fan art by Fatima Kelley: [Photos + Review: Dead & Company @ North Island Credit Union Amphitheatre (Chula Vista, CA) - Mezzic](https://www.mezzic.com/concert-photos/photos-review-dead-company-north-island-credit-union-amphitheatre-chula-vista-ca/) [9]",
